# Test cost — every agent

Read and follow **Test cost and coverage** in `CLAUDE.md`. This applies to primary
agents, delegated subagents, automated fixers and reviewers; include the policy in
delegated task briefs.

- Identify missing behavior; use the cheapest adequate layer and reuse tests and
  fixtures. TDD can extend an existing test; each change does not need a new file
  or full browser/native journey.
- Justify new expensive journeys by distinct coverage and report observed setup,
  test and CI cost in the PR template using existing evidence. Explain unavailable
  measurements; do not launch extra full suites solely for reporting.
- Retain real boundary coverage, required tests/gates and operation deadlines.
  Share setup only while isolation, authority, ownership and cancellation remain
  correct. Diagnose material cost growth and avoidable repeated setup in review.
